{"ref":"BDB, אוֹצָר","hw":"אוֹצָר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹצָר</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.16\">Pr 15:16</a></sup> <strong>treasure, store, treasury, storehouse (</strong>so Aramaic, also <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܰܘܨܪܳܐ</span> <strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹצָר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.16\">Pr 15:16</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹצַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:19\" href=\"/Joshua.6.19\">Jos 6:19</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹצָרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.12\">Dt 28:12</a> + 2 times; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹצָרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:17\" href=\"/Joel.1.17\">Jo 1:17</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹצָרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:6\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.6\">Pr 21:6</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹצְרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.2\">Pr 10:2</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹצְרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 38:22\" href=\"/Job.38.22\">Jb 38:22</a> +; pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹצְרֹתָֽי׃</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:34\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.34\">Dt 32:34</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 39:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.39.4\">Is 39:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹצְרֹתָֽי׃</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:34\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.34\">Dt 32:34</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹצְרוֹתֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.3\">Je 17:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹצְרוֹתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.6\">Is 30:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹצְרֹתֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.21\">Pr 8:21</a>, etc.—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>treasure</em>(<em>s</em>), gen. pl. (gold, silver, costly utensils, etc.) <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:19\" href=\"/Joshua.6.19\">Jos 6:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:24\" href=\"/Joshua.6.24\">24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 2:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.2.7\">Is 2:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.6\">30:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.3\">45:3</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ חֹשֶׁךְ</span>, i.e. concealed, hoarded) <a data-ref=\"Hosea 13:15\" href=\"/Hosea.13.15\">Ho 13:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.13\">Je 15:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.3\">17:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.5\">20:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.7\">48:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.4\">49:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.13\">51:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:26\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.26\">1 K 14:26</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 24:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.24.13\">2 K 24:13</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, perhaps also <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 39:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.39.2\">Is 39:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 39:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.39.4\">4</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Kings 20:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.20.13\">2 K 20:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 20:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.20.15\">15</a>; wealth <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.16\">Pr 15:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:6\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.6\">21:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.20\">20</a>; gathered for temple-building (sg.) <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ בֵּית י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.8\">1 Ch 29:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ הַמְּלָאכָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:69\" href=\"/Ezra.2.69\">Ezr 2:69</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:70\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.70\">Ne 7:71</a>(<a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:69\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.69\">70</a>), also v <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:69\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.69\">70</a>(<a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:68\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.68\">69</a>) (cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:27\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.27\">1 Ch 26:27</a>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>store</em>, supply of food, drink, etc., <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 11:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.11.11\">2 Ch 11:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:27\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.27\">1 Ch 27:27</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:28\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.28\">28</a>; fig. <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ רֶשַׁע</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 6:10\" href=\"/Micah.6.10\">Mi 6:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.2\">Pr 10:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יִרְאַת י׳ הִיא אוֹצָרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.6\">Is 33:6</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית אוֹצָר</span> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>treasure-house</em> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:39\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.39\">Ne 10:39</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:2\" href=\"/Daniel.1.2\">Dn 1:2</a>; <strong>b.</strong>  <em>storehouse, magazine</em> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:10\" href=\"/Malachi.3.10\">Mal 3:10</a>; & without <span dir=\"rtl\">בית</span><br><strong>4.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>treasure-house</em> or <em>chamber, treasury</em> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:51\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.51\">1 K 7:51</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 15:18\" href=\"/I_Kings.15.18\">15:18</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:19\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.19\">2 K 12:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:14\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.14\">14:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 16:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.16.8\">16:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.15\">18:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 38:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.38.11\">Je 38:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:37\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.37\">50:37</a> (?) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:26\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.26\">1 Ch 9:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:20\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.20\">26:20</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.24\">24</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:26\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.26\">26</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.12\">28:12</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 5:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.5.1\">2 C